fix: Child task indentation, completed children, and source marker control
- Fix child task indentation to preserve tabs/spaces from source file
- Add safety check to prevent completed/cancelled children from being migrated
- Add (...) syntax for source marker control (e.g., [>w(/)] keeps [/] in source)
- Support combined source and destination markers: [>w(/){=}]
- Update README with new marker syntax documentation
- Add test cases for indentation and source marker features
- Bump version to 0.2.0